    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 18.68,
      "text": "Soviet reports claimed the first dog in orbit survived for days.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Laika in 1957.jpg",
        "credit": "\u041c\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0438 / \u0413\u043b\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0432 \u041c\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0432\u044b",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Laika_in_1957.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 9.333,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.333,
          "end": 18.667,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 18.68,
      "end": 22.56,
      "text": "Soviet engineers had rushed to assemble Sputnik 2 in under four weeks.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Nikita Khrushchev in East Berlin - Flickr - The Central Intelligence Agency.jpg",
        "credit": "The Central Intelligence Agency",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nikita_Khrushchev_in_East_Berlin_-_Flickr_-_The_Central_Intelligence_Agency.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 18.667,
          "end": 20.6,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.6,
          "end": 22.567,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 22.56,
      "end": 27.12,
      "text": "Trainers prepared Moscow stray Laika by confining her in shrinking cages for twenty days.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "\u041b\u0430\u0439\u043a\u0430 (\u0441\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043a\u0430-\u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0442)1.jpg",
        "credit": "unknown - likely Soviet space program",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BA%D0%B0_(%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82)1.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 22.567,
          "end": 24.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 24.867,
          "end": 27.133,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 27.12,
      "end": 31.2,
      "text": "Inside the tiny capsule, chains locked her so tightly she could not turn around.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "\u041b\u0430\u0439\u043a\u0430 (\u0441\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043a\u0430-\u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0442)2.jpg",
        "credit": "uknown",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BA%D0%B0_(%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82)2.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 27.133,
          "end": 29.167,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 29.167,
          "end": 31.2,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 31.2,
      "end": 35.78,
      "text": "In weightlessness, medical sensors showed her heartbeat took three times longer to calm.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Romania 1957 MI 1678, 1680 stamp triptych (Launching of Artificial Satellite by Russia. Sputnik 1 and Earth. Label. Sputniks 1 and 2 circling globe) 1200dpi.jpg",
        "credit": "\"Posta Romana\" (\u0420\u0438\u0441. \u0418\u043e\u043d \u0414\u0443\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430 (Ion Dumitrana) (1923\u20141976) \u0438 \u0414\u0438\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0435 \u0428\u0442\u044e\u0431\u0435\u0439 (Dimitrie \u0218tiubei) (1901\u20141986)).",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Romania_1957_MI_1678,_1680_stamp_triptych_(Launching_of_Artificial_Satellite_by_Russia._Sputnik_1_and_Earth._Label._Sputniks_1_and_2_circling_globe)_1200dpi.jpg"
      },
